# AI Prompt Quality Analyzer

## Project Overview
This project explores how prompt design impacts AI output quality. It demonstrates how structured prompts improve clarity, accuracy, and usefulness of AI-generated responses.

## Objective
To analyze and improve prompt engineering skills by:
- Comparing weak vs strong prompts
- Iterating on prompt design
- Evaluating AI responses

## Tools Used
- ChatGPT
- Google Gemini

## Key Concept
AI performs best when tasks are clearly defined and constrained. Poor prompts lead to vague or incorrect outputs.

## Core Features
- Prompt breakdown analysis
- Prompt refinement suggestions
- Demonstration of prompt engineering principles

## Learning Outcome
This project demonstrates how structured prompting improves AI performance and aligns with real-world applications.
